<title>NEW ZEALAND: Strathmore raises buy-back to 36 cps.</title>
<headline>Strathmore raises buy-back to 36 cps.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Strathmore Group said on Monday that it would increase its offer to buy back its own shares to NZ 36 cents from 34 cents per share.</p>
<p>The shares closed on Friday at 35 cents.</p>
<p>ANZ Securities is acting on behalf of Strathmore.</p>
<p>--Wellington Newsroom (64 4) 4734746</p>
</text>
